dataframe_schema.description:
Schema of the resulting dataframe after transformations, in Spark StructType JSON format (from df.schema.json()).
Required if transformation_sql is specified.
Example: {"type":"struct","fields":[{"name":"col_a","type":"integer","nullable":true,"metadata":{}},{"name":"col_c","type":"integer","nullable":true,"metadata":{}}]}

tags.description:
Caller-owned; the server never writes system values here. At most 10
entries. Keys match ^[A-Za-z0-9_.:/-]+$ and are at most 128 UTF-8 bytes;
values are at most 256 UTF-8 bytes.

ml.IssueSourceType.description:
What created an Issue: ADHOC_RUN, an issue detection run started on demand;
SCHEDULED_RUN, one started by a schedule; SINGLE_TRACE_ANALYSIS, an analysis
of a single trace; or MANUAL, a person.

